    "body": "fix on issue/3831-verify-keepdown-speed · PR #3977 · pinned by verify::slab_tests (5 tests), verify::slab::tests (5 tests) and verify::reach_tests · merges when reviewed\n\nFinding: the slow steps in `verify_bodies` for a ramped path were three. Law (b) sectioned the model at the end plane of each ramp move. Law (b) asked the wall probe for each region edge of each move. Law (c) took the wall samples of each plane (61.5 million samples for 2,422 moves). Release build, 38,432 facets, one ring: 282 s before, 1.2 s after, with the same moves and the same warnings.\n\nThe PR changes what law (c) samples on a ramped path. The decision is in `docs/decisions/3831-verify-keepdown-speed.md`.\n",
